<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>The University of Jordan</title>

<style>

body{
    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.9)), url("uj_logo.png");
    background-size: contain;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    margin:0;
    padding:20px;
}

h1{
    color:black;
    font-size:40px;
    text-align:center;
}

p{
    color:red;
    font-size:18px;
    width:70%;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    margin:auto;
    line-height:1.6;
}

span{
    color:green;
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:22px;
}

/* List Style */
ul{
    width:50%;
    margin:30px auto;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    font-size:20px;
}

li{
    color:blue;
    margin:10px 0;
}

table{
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin:40px auto;
}

td{
    width:80px;
    height:50px;
    border:1px solid black;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:18px;
    transition:0.3s;
}

tr:hover td{
    background-color: lightblue;
}

td:hover::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    background-color: lightgreen;
    width:100%;
    height:500px;
    top:-250px;
    left:0;
    z-index:-1;
}

td:hover{
    background-color: orange !important;
    position:relative;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>The University of Jordan</h1>

<p>
The <span>University of Jordan</span> (UJ) is one of the leading universities in Jordan 
and the Middle East. It was established in <span>1962</span> and is located in <span>Amman</span>,
the capital city of Jordan.
</p>

<!-- List Added -->
<ul>
    <li>Faculty of IT</li>
    <li>Faculty of Engineering</li>
    <li>Faculty of Medicine</li>
    <li>Faculty of Business</li>
</ul>

<table>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>2</td>
<td>3</td>
<td>4</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td>6</td>
<td>7</td>
<td>8</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>9</td>
<td>10</td>
<td>11</td>
<td>12</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>13</td>
<td>14</td>
<td>15</td>
<td>16</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
